    "detailed_description": "<i>Firefight!</i> is a fast-paced, one-player arcade game where the player must navigate burning buildings in order to put out fires and rescue trapped hostages. It\u2019s a lot like the classic arcade maze runners of the 80s, but with colorful, high-resolution, hand-drawn art.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Story</h2><br>The year is 21XX. The evil Flame Gang is terrorizing the city of Neo Alva, trapping hostages within burning buildings. In response, Duck the fire-fighting robot is sent in to rescue the hostages and extinguish the threat of the Flame Gang once and for all!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 25 fast-paced levels!<br></li><li> In addition to regular gameplay, players will have to master door-and-switch puzzles, light-switch puzzles, and water flow levels. Players will also have to manage toxic waste that makes enemies even more powerful if left untreated.<br></li><li> Side challenges and unlockable achievements throughout the game, to reward the most skilled players.<br></li><li> An all-original soundtrack, composed by veteran jazz musician Max Ridgway!</li></ul><br>With its simple story and intuitive controls, anyone can pick up <i>Firefight!</i>",
